    {
      "flavor_text": "はったつした　うきぶくろで　うかぶ。\nおぼれた　ひとを　きゅうじょする\nてつだいを　している　ポケモンだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "발달한 부낭으로 뜬다.\n물에 빠진 사람을 구조하는 것을\n돕는 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il flotte grâce à sa bouée très développée. Il vole au\nsecours des gens sur le point de se noyer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es treibt mithilfe einer Art Rettungsring auf dem\nWasser und hilft dem, der zu ertrinken droht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nada gracias a su flotador. Ayuda en los rescates de\ngente que se está ahogando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nuota con il suo grosso galleggiante e aiuta a\nsoccorrere chi sta per annegare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It floats using its well-developed flotation sac.\nIt assists in the rescues of drowning people.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "発達した　浮き袋で　浮かぶ。\nおぼれた　人を　救助する\n手伝いを　している　ポケモンだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nada gracias a su flotador. Ayuda en los rescates de\ngente que se está ahogando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すいちゅうの　えものを　おいかける\nうちに　うきぶくろが　はったつした。\nゴムボートのように　ひとを　のせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수중의 먹이를 쫓아가는\n사이에 부낭이 발달했다.\n고무보트처럼 사람을 태운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a développé une bouée pour poursuivre ses proies\naquatiques. Elle fait office de canot gonflable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es seit jeher Beute im Wasser jagt,\nentwickelte es einen Rettungsring.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su flotador se desarrolló a raíz de perseguir presas\nacuáticas. También sirve como balsa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo galleggiante, che funge da gommone, si è\nsviluppato perché caccia le prede nell’acqua.",
